    <\associate|figure>
      <tuple|normal|<surround|<hidden-binding|<tuple>|3.1>||Left: a sample of
      the massive GFF on <with|mode|<quote|math>|\<bbb-T\><rsup|2>>
      (<with|mode|<quote|math>|m=4>, Fourier cutoff
      <with|mode|<quote|math>|512<rsup|2>>, zero mode removed). It is not a
      function: refining the cutoff adds fluctuations at all scales. Right:
      the Green function <with|mode|<quote|math>|G<rsub|m>> in
      <with|mode|<quote|math>|d=1,2,3>: bounded, logarithmic and
      <with|mode|<quote|math>|<around|\||x|\|><rsup|-1>> singularities at the
      origin, and exponential decay at infinity.>|<pageref|auto-4>>

      <tuple|normal|<surround|<hidden-binding|<tuple>|3.2>||Reflection
      positivity (Proposition <no-break><specific|screen|<resize|<move|<with|color|<quote|#A0A0FF>|->|-0.3em|>|0em||0em|>><reference|prop:RP>).
      For <with|mode|<quote|math>|f> supported in
      <with|mode|<quote|math>|<around|{|\<tau\>\<gtr\>0|}>> the covariance
      between <with|mode|<quote|math>|f> and its mirror image factorises
      through the time-zero plane: <with|mode|<quote|math>|<around|\<langle\>|\<Theta\>*f,C*f|\<rangle\>>=<around|\<\|\|\>|<around|(|2*\<omega\>|)><rsup|-1/2>*<big|int><rsub|0><rsup|\<infty\>>\<mathe\><rsup|-\<tau\>*\<omega\>>f<around|(|\<tau\>|)>\<mathd\>\<tau\>|\<\|\|\>><rsup|2>\<geq\>0>.>|<pageref|auto-6>>

      <tuple|normal|<surround|<hidden-binding|<tuple>|3.3>||Parabolic
      stochastic quantisation of the GFF on a circle of length
      <with|mode|<quote|math>|8>, <with|mode|<quote|math>|m=1>, started from
      <with|mode|<quote|math>|\<Phi\><rsub|0>=0>. Left: a sample of the
      solution. Right: each Fourier mode is an Ornstein\UUhlenbeck process,
      whose variance relaxes to <with|mode|<quote|math>|\<lambda\><rsub|k><rsup|-1>>
      at rate <with|mode|<quote|math>|2*\<lambda\><rsub|k>> (Theorem
      <no-break><specific|screen|<resize|<move|<with|color|<quote|#A0A0FF>|->|-0.3em|>|0em||0em|>><reference|thm:parabolic>(c)).
      Dots: Monte Carlo estimates with <with|mode|<quote|math>|4000>
      samples.>|<pageref|auto-15>>
